│ Okay, after repeated failures with the API calls, I’ve manually    │
│ reviewed the code context provided. The core issue is that         │
│ viewcode is generating EPUB files even when                        │
│ viewcode_enable_epub=False. This appears to be happening because   │
│ the viewcode extension is attempting to generate EPUB pages        │
│ regardless of the setting. The fix involves ensuring that the EPUB │
│ generation is skipped when viewcode_enable_epub is false. I've     │
│ identified the relevant part of the viewcode extension logic       │
│ within the generate_page method.                                   │
│                                                                    │
│ Here's the patch:                                                  │
│                                                                    │
│ ┏━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┓ │
